source_formula:
 egin{aligned}
\langle\mu,\mu'angle=\mu(s)
&= rac1{\operatorname{St}_G(s)}
\sum_{\substack{T\s\in T}}
\sum_{	heta\in(T^F)^\vee}
	heta(s^{-1})
 rac{(-1)^{\sigma(G)-\sigma(Z^0(s))}}{\operatorname{St}_{Z^0(s)}(e)|T^F|}
\sum_{\substack{g\in G^F\g^{-1}sg\in T^F}}	heta(g^{-1}sg)\
&= rac1{\operatorname{St}_G(s)^2}
\sum_{\substack{T\s\in T}}
\sum_{\substack{g\in G^F\g^{-1}sg\in T^F}}
|T^F|^{-1}	heta(s^{-1})	heta(g^{-1}sg)\
&= rac1{\operatorname{St}_G(s)^2}
\#\{T
i s,\ g\in G^F\mid sg=gs\}\
&= rac{|Z(s)^F|}{\operatorname{St}_G(s)^2}
\#\{F	ext{-stable maximal tori in }Z^0(s)\}
=|Z(s)^F|,
\end{aligned}

